<title>PERU: SOCCER-PERU BEAT UNITED STATES 4-1 IN SOCCER FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PERU BEAT UNITED STATES 4-1 IN SOCCER FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA, Peru 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru beat the United States</p>
<p>4-1 (halftime 1-1) in an international soccer friendly at</p>
<p>Lima's National Stadium on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Peru - Roberto Palacios (33rd min), Percy Olivares (67th),</p>
<p>Paolo Maldonado (73rd), Nolberto Solano (83rd)</p>
<p>United States - Dario Brose (44th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,019</p>
